                    <div class="member-info">
                        <p class="member-part">Baritone</p>
                        <h2 class="member-name">Steven Rutherford</h2>
                        <p class="member-bio">Steven is currently studying at Trinity Western University as a percussion major with a love for singing and piano. He has been singing barbershop since 2019, introduced to the genre by his high school teacher from Westcoast Harmony Chorus through the local "Young Singers in Harmony" event. His musical director from the Cloverdale Chordsmen later recommended his youngest singers — Steven among them — to form a quartet, and the rest is history. "It is always a treat to be exposed to this historic genre of music!"</p>
